[{"answer":"Hello?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh hello.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I was hoping to speak to Jack Fitzgerald about renting a cottage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm his wife, Shirley, and we own the cottages together,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/4.mp3"},{"answer":"so I'm sure I can help you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/6.mp3"},{"answer":"My name's Tom.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Some friends of ours rented Granary Cottage from you last year,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/8.mp3"},{"answer":"and they thought it was great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/9.mp3"},{"answer":"So my wife and I are hoping to come in May for a week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/10.mp3"},{"answer":"What date did you have in mind?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/11.mp3"},{"answer":"The week beginning the 14th, if possible.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll just check...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sorry, Tom, it's already booked that week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/14.mp3"},{"answer":"It's free the week beginning the 28th, though, for seven nights.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/15.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, that's the only time you could have it in May.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we could manage that, I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/17.mp3"},{"answer":"We'd just need to change a couple of things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/18.mp3"},{"answer":"How much would it cost?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/19.mp3"},{"answer":"That's the beginning of high season,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/20.mp3"},{"answer":"so it'd be £550 for the week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/21.mp3"},{"answer":"That's a bit more than we wanted to pay, I'm afraid.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/22.mp3"},{"answer":"We've budgeted up to £500 for accommodation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we've just finished converting another building into a cottage,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/24.mp3"},{"answer":"which we're calling Chervil Cottage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Sorry? What was that again?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Chervil.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/27.mp3"},{"answer":"C H E R V for Victor I L.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's a herb, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/29.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/30.mp3"},{"answer":"It grows fairly wild around here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/31.mp3"},{"answer":"You could have that for the week you want for £480.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/32.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/33.mp3"},{"answer":"So could you tell me something about it, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/35.mp3"},{"answer":"The building was built as a garage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/36.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a little smaller than Granary Cottage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/37.mp3"},{"answer":"So that must sleep two people, as well?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/38.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/39.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a double bedroom.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Does it have a garden?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, you get to it from the living room through French doors,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/42.mp3"},{"answer":"and we provide two deckchairs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/43.mp3"},{"answer":"We hope to build a patio in the near future,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/44.mp3"},{"answer":"but I wouldn't like to guarantee it'll be finished by May.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/45.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/46.mp3"},{"answer":"The front door opens onto the old farmyard,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/47.mp3"},{"answer":"and parking isn't a problem -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/48.mp3"},{"answer":"there's plenty of room at the front for that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/49.mp3"},{"answer":"There are some trees and potted plants there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/50.mp3"},{"answer":"What about facilities in the cottage?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/51.mp3"},{"answer":"It has standard things like a cooker and fridge, I presume.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/52.mp3"},{"answer":"In the kitchen area there's a fridge-freezer","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/53.mp3"},{"answer":"and we've just put in an electric cooker.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there a washing machine?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/56.mp3"},{"answer":"There's also a TV in the living room, which plays DVDs too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/57.mp3"},{"answer":"The bathroom is too small for a bath,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/58.mp3"},{"answer":"so there's a shower instead.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/59.mp3"},{"answer":"I think a lot of people prefer that nowadays, anyway.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/60.mp3"},{"answer":"It's more environmentally friendly, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Unless you spend half the day in it!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/63.mp3"},{"answer":"What about heating?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/64.mp3"},{"answer":"It sometimes gets quite cool at that time of year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/65.mp3"},{"answer":"There's central heating, and if you want to light a fire, there's a stove.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/66.mp3"},{"answer":"We can provide all the wood you need for it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/67.mp3"},{"answer":"It smells so much nicer than coal,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/68.mp3"},{"answer":"and it makes the room very cosy -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/69.mp3"},{"answer":"we've got one in our own house.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/70.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds very pleasant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Perhaps we should come in the winter, to make the most of it!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, we find we don't want to go out when we've got the fire burning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/73.mp3"},{"answer":"There are some attractive views from the cottage, which I haven't mentioned.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/74.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a famous stone bridge -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/75.mp3"},{"answer":"it's one of the oldest in the region,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/76.mp3"},{"answer":"and you can see it from the living room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/77.mp3"},{"answer":"It isn't far away.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/78.mp3"},{"answer":"The bedroom window looks in the opposite direction,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/79.mp3"},{"answer":"and has a lovely view of the hills and the monument at the top.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that all sounds perfect.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/81.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to book it, please.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Would you want a deposit?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, we ask for 30% to secure your booking,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/84.mp3"},{"answer":"so that'll be... £144.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/85.mp3"},{"answer":"And when would you like the rest of the money?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/86.mp3"},{"answer":"You're coming in May, so the last day of March, please.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/87.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/88.mp3"},{"answer":"Excellent.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/89.mp3"},{"answer":"Could I just take your details...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-4-part-1-2023-01-05-22-48-14/90.mp3"}]
